{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"泛等性"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"泛等性"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"类型论","text":"类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, <strong>泛等性</strong> (univalence) 是两种相等之间的等价: 对于类型 $A,B$, 有\n$$\r\n(A = B) \\overset{\\simeq}{\\longrightarrow} (A\\simeq B).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"UF","text":"泛等基础"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴对象","text":"完备 Segal 对象"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}